---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="MCP Server — Documentazione" description="Server MCP per AI agent: risorse, strumenti e prompt per interagire con l'intero corpus Unpeeragogy.">
  <section class="py-12 max-w-4xl mx-auto" data-pagefind-body>
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-2">⚡ MCP Server</h1>
    <p class="d-text-sec mb-8">
      Il server MCP espone l'intero corpus Unpeeragogy agli AI agent tramite il Model Context Protocol.
      Risorse, strumenti e prompt per la decostruzione.
    </p>

    <div class="flex gap-3 mb-10">
      <a href="/mcp/it/" class="rounded-lg bg-(--color-accent) px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-(--color-accent-light) transition-colors">Italiano</a>
      <a href="/mcp/en/" class="rounded-lg border border-stone-300 d-border px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-stone-100 d-hover transition-colors">English</a>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <a href="/mcp/it/" class="block p-5 border border-stone-200 d-border rounded-lg hover:bg-stone-50 d-hover transition-colors">
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-(--color-accent)">Documentazione IT</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm d-text-sec">Guida completa in italiano: risorse, strumenti, prompt, esempi d'uso.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/mcp/en/" class="block p-5 border border-stone-200 d-border rounded-lg hover:bg-stone-50 d-hover transition-colors">
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-(--color-accent)">Documentation EN</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm d-text-sec">Complete guide in English: resources, tools, prompts, usage examples.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="https://github.com/pyragogy/unpeeragogy/tree/main/packages/mcp-server" target="_blank" class="block p-5 border border-stone-200 d-border rounded-lg hover:bg-stone-50 d-hover transition-colors">
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-(--color-accent)">Source Code</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm d-text-sec">Vai al repository GitHub — codice del server MCP.</p>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 p-6 border border-stone-200 d-border rounded-lg bg-stone-50 d-surface">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mb-3">Connessione rapida</h2>
      <p class="text-sm d-text-sec mb-4">Per Claude Desktop, Cline, o qualsiasi client MCP:</p>
      <pre class="text-xs bg-white dark:[background:var(--surface-bg)] p-4 rounded-lg overflow-x-auto border border-stone-200 d-border"><code>
&#123;
  "mcpServers": &#123;
    "unpeeragogy": &#123;
      "url": "https://mcp.unpeeragogy.pyragogy.org/sse?token=&lt;MCP_AUTH_TOKEN&gt;"
    &#125;
  &#125;
&#125;
</code></pre>
      <p class="mt-3 text-xs d-text-dim">Richiedi il token via email: <code>&#x69;&#x6e;&#x66;&#x6f;&#x40;&#x70;&#x79;&#x72;&#x61;&#x67;&#x6f;&#x67;&#x79;&#x2e;&#x6f;&#x72;&#x67;</code> (Fabrizio, admin).
      Una volta ottenuto, esegui: <code>npx @pyragogy/mcp-server --setup --token &lt;token&gt;</code></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
